    <string name="app_name" translatable="false">Kursor</string>

    <string name="disclaimer">Kursor is an independent TV browser built for watching video with a remote. It is not affiliated with the websites you open in it; you use those sites with your own accounts and under their terms.

Your sign-ins and viewing data stay on this TV only. They are never sent to the developer or to any other server.</string>

